---
description: Keep implementation traceable to one active Spec Kit phase.
globs: "specs/**/*.md"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Maintain one active phase with `spec.md`, `plan.md`, and `tasks.md`.
- Derive product behavior from repository-local canonical documents.
- Record open product questions and block affected implementation.
- Keep acceptance criteria testable and tasks dependency-ordered.
- Make module ownership, public contracts, authorization, audit, migrations, and tests explicit.
- Do not implement future phase scope.
- Initialize `.specify/` only through an inspected official Spec Kit CLI workflow.
